graph TD
    subgraph "Producer Layer (Microservices)"
        A[Air/Ocean/User/Tracking] -->|1. Appender| B{Log4j2 Engine}
        B -->|2. Masking Plugin| C[Sanitized Logs]
        C -->|3. MDC/TraceID| D[JSON Structured Log]
    end

    subgraph "Transit Layer (Resilient/Async)"
        D --> E[Fluent Bit Sidecar]
        E -->|mTLS Encryption| F[Kafka Cluster]
    end

    subgraph "Processing Layer (Compliance/Enrichment)"
        F -->|Secure Ingestion| G[Logstash / GCP Cloud Logging]
        G -->|Parsing & Indexing| H[Elasticsearch]
    end

    subgraph "Governance Layer (Auditor Ready)"
        H -->|Hot Data| I[Kibana Dashboard]
        H -->|Archive| J[Immutable Storage: GCS WORM]
    end

    subgraph "Security Controls"
        K[SSO + MFA Access] -.-> I
        L[Audit Logs: Index Lock] -.-> J
        M[RBAC Restrictions] -.-> H
    end

    style J fill:#ff9999,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px
    style C fill:#99ff99,stroke:#333
    style B fill:#bbf,stroke:#333